        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Charming 3 bed bungalow on c. 0.3 acre mature grounds. Featuring a bright, modern interior the proprty commands panoramic countryside views to Lough Ine hill. Discreetly located off the Baltimore road within a short walk of Skibbereen town."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Entrance Porch - 1.8m x 1.2m \r\nTiled floor, sliding glass door.\r\n\r\nEntrance Hall - 4.2m x 1.8m \r\nOak floor, glass panel doors to porch.\r\n\r\nSitting Room - 4.6m x 3.8m \r\nOak floor, insert stove, panoramic countryside views.\r\n\r\nDining Room - 3.8m x 2.6m \r\nOak floor, panoramic countryside views.\r\n\r\nKitchen - \r\nTiled floor, modern painted kitchen units, electric cooker, extractor, fridge freezer, dishwasher, garden views.\r\n\r\nInner Hall - 6.0m x 1.2m \r\nOak floor, closet with stira stairs to attic.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - 4.6m x 3.8m \r\nBuilt in wardrobe, panoramic countryside views.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 3.6m x 2.8m \r\nWooden floor, garden views.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 - 3.6m x 2.8m \r\nWooden floor, garden views.\r\n\r\nBathroom - 3.4m x 1.7m \r\nTiled, shower unit, vanity unit, w.c.\r\n\r\nShed - 4.0m x 3.7m \r\nElectricity, washing machine, dryer.\r\n\r\n"
      },
